<view class="tech-page visit-page"><view class="visit-heading"><view class="visit-symbol"><van-icon name="calendar-o" size="28px" /></view><view class="tech-title">{{rework?'选择返修上门时段':'选择上门时段'}}</view><view class="tech-subtitle">{{rework?'请选择方便原师傅上门的时段，师傅确认后预约成立。':confirmContinuation?'确认继续维修并保存期望时段后，平台将安排派单。':'选一个方便的时间，师傅确认接单后预约成立'}}</view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="上门安排暂不可用" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{result.preferredVisit}}" class="visit-current"><van-icon name="clock-o" size="18px" /><view><text>当前期望时段</text><view>{{currentText}}</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{canSave||pending}}"><view class="tech-section"><text class="tech-section__title">上门日期</text><text class="tech-caption">北京时间</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="visit-dates"><view wx:for="{{dates}}" wx:key="key" class="visit-date {{date===item.key?'visit-date--selected':''}}" data-date="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onDate"><text>{{item.week}}</text><view>{{item.day}}</view></view></view></scroll-view><view class="tech-section"><text class="tech-section__title">期望时段</text><text class="tech-caption">每段2小时</text></view><view class="visit-periods"><view wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="key" class="visit-period {{selected===item.key?'visit-period--selected':''}} {{item.disabled?'visit-period--disabled':''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onPeriod"><text>{{item.label}}</text><van-icon wx:if="{{selected===item.key}}" name="checked" size="16px" /></view></view></block><view wx:else class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="info-o" /><text>当前任务已有上门安排或正在履约。需要调整已确认预约时，请从工单详情申请改约。</text></view><view class="visit-explanation"><view><van-icon name="shield-o" /><text>师傅会结合设备、服务区域与时段决定是否接单</text></view><view><van-icon name="passed" /><text>接单前是期望时间，接单后双方预约成立</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{saveError}}" class="tech-form-error">{{saveError}}</view><button wx:if="{{!canSave&&!pending}}" class="tech-btn tech-btn--outline" bindtap="onOrder">查看工单详情</button></block><view wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&(canSave||pending)}}" class="tech-dock"><button class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||(!pending&&!selected)}}" bindtap="onSave">{{pending?'恢复上次选择结果':confirmContinuation?'确认继续维修并保存时段':'确认这个时段'}}</button></view></view>
